{"version":"bsb","book":"psalms","chapter":42,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","level":1,"text":"BOOK II"},{"kind":"title","text":"Psalms 42–72"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"As the Deer Pants for the Water"},{"kind":"title","text":"For the choirmaster. A Maskil of the sons of Korah."},{"kind":"break"},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":1,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"As the deer pants for streams of water,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":1,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"so my soul longs after You, O God."}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":2,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"My soul thirsts for God, the living God."}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":2,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"When shall I come and appear in God’s presence?"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":3,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"My tears have been my food"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":3,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"both day and night,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":3,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"while men ask me all day long,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":3,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"“Where is your God?”"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":4,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"These things come to mind as I pour out my soul:"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":4,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"how I walked with the multitude,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":4,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"leading the festive procession to the house of God"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":4,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"with shouts of joy and praise."}]},{"kind":"break"},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":5,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"Why are you downcast, O my soul?"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":5,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"Why the unease within me?"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":5,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"Put your hope in God, for I will yet praise Him"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":5,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"for the salvation of His presence."}]},{"kind":"break"},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":6,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"O my God, my soul despairs within me."}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":6,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"Therefore I remember You"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":6,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"from the land of Jordan and the peaks of Hermon —"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":6,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"even from Mount Mizar."}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":7,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"Deep calls to deep"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":7,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"in the roar of Your waterfalls;"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":7,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"all Your breakers and waves"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":7,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"have rolled over me."}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":8,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"The LORD decrees His loving devotion by day,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":8,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"and at night His song is with me"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":8,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"as a prayer to the God of my life."}]},{"kind":"break"},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":9,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"I say to God my Rock,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":9,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"“Why have You forgotten me?"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":9,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"Why must I walk in sorrow"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":9,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"because of the enemy’s oppression?”"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":10,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"Like the crushing of my bones,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":10,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"my enemies taunt me,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":10,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"while they say to me all day long,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":10,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"“Where is your God?”"}]},{"kind":"break"},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":11,"end":null,"start":true,"text":"Why are you downcast, O my soul?"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":11,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"Why the unease within me?"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":1,"runs":[{"verse":11,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"Put your hope in God, for I will yet praise Him,"}]},{"kind":"poetry","indent":2,"runs":[{"verse":11,"end":null,"start":false,"text":"my Savior and my God."}]}]}
